   "widgets_values": [
    "Animate this split-screen reference as two synchronized fixed-camera views of the SAME person performing the SAME action at the SAME time. Left panel is a front view; right panel is a three-quarter view. Preserve both camera angles and the central divider throughout. The person walks naturally toward the front camera: four relaxed steps with clear heel strikes, toe-offs and alternating arm swing, then stops with both feet planted. Realistic planted soles and weight transfer, stable limb anatomy. Full body, hands and feet remain visible with margin throughout. Preserve identity, proportions, clothing, neutral background and lighting. No camera movement, cuts, extra limbs, props, or changes to the panel layout.",
